    "directions": [
      "For the recipe of the easy chocolate mousse with hot coffee, break the chocolate, melt it in a bain-marie or in the microwave (power 500 W for 2-3 minutes) then let it cool down.",
      "Whip the cream, leaving it rather soft (half-whipped). Little by little pour the cream over the melted chocolate, mixing gently.",
      "Pour the mousse obtained in the coffee cups that you will put in the freezer for about 30 minutes.",
      "Remove from the freezer just before serving, pouring espresso coffee into each cup, and topping with a sprinkle of cinnamon."
